+### I. How We Collect and Use Your Personal Information
+
+- **1.Circumstances of Collecting Personal Information**
+
+The product license activation mechanism generates a machine code for applying for a formal product license based on information such as the network card, firmware, and motherboard of the computer you use through an encryption mechanism and conversion method. You send this machine code to Kylin Software business personnel to apply for a formal license activation according to the contract and related agreements. This machine code does not directly contain specific information about the network card, firmware, motherboard, and other equipment of the computer you use.
+
+The server side of the product's software store will connect based on the CPU type information and IP address of the computer you use. At the same time, we will collect information related to your use of the product's software store, including but not limited to the time the software store is opened, interactions between pages, search content, downloaded content, etc. The collected relevant information is generally recorded in the log of the software store's server system, and the specific storage location may vary depending on different service scenarios.
+
+Collect personal information such as email address, telephone number, and name from you due to business dealings and technical services.
+
+The product's biometric management tool supports system components using biometrics for authentication, including fingerprints, finger veins, irises, voiceprints, etc. The biometric information you enter will be stored on the local computer. We only receive the verification result and will not collect or upload this information. If you do not need to use biometrics for system authentication, you can turn off this function in the biometric management tool.
+
+The product provides a recording function. When you use the product's recording software, we will only store the audio content during your recording on the local computer and will not collect or upload it.
+
+The product's service and support function will collect logs, email addresses, telephone numbers, names, and other information provided by you to us to facilitate technical services. We will properly keep your personal information.
+
+During the product upgrade process, if it is necessary to newly collect your personal information, we will update this section in a timely manner.
