+We have established specialized management systems, processes, and organizations to ensure information security. For example, we strictly limit the range of personnel who have access to information and require them to comply with confidentiality obligations.
+
+- **4.Contingency Plan**
+
+In the event of a personal information breach or other security incident, we will lawfully initiate a contingency plan to prevent the security incident from expanding, and inform you of the situation of the security incident, the possible impact on you, and the remedial measures we will take by means of push notifications, announcements, etc. We will also report the handling of personal information security incidents to the regulatory authorities as required by laws and regulations.
+
+### III. How to Manage Your Personal Information
+
+If you are concerned about the leakage of personal information due to the use of this product, you can consider suspending or not using the relevant functions involving personal information according to personal and business needs, such as formal product license, application store, system update upgrade, biometric identification, etc.
+
+When using third-party software/services on top of this product, please pay attention to personal privacy protection.
+
+### IV. Privacy Explanation Regarding Third-Party Software/Services
+
+The third-party software/services referred to in this agreement are related software/services developed by other organizations or individuals other than the manufacturer of the Kylin OS Desktop Operating System. When you install or use third-party software/services on top of this product, the privacy protection and legal responsibility of the third-party software/services are the responsibility of the third-party software/services themselves. Please carefully read and review the privacy statements or terms corresponding to the third-party software/services and pay attention to personal privacy protection.
+
+### V. About Minors Using the Product
+
+If you are a minor, you need the consent of your guardian to use this product and agree to the relevant service terms. Except for providing the information necessary for the product, we do not intentionally require minors to provide more data. After obtaining the consent or authorization of the guardian, the account created by the minor is regarded as equivalent to any other account. We have formulated special information processing rules to protect the personal information security of minors using this product. Guardians should also take appropriate preventive measures to protect minors and supervise their use of this product.
+
+### VI. How This Statement is Updated
+
+We may update this Statement at any time and will show you the changed Statement through the product installation process or the company website when changes occur. Using the service or any software licensed under these terms after these changes take effect means you agree to the new terms. If you do not agree to the new terms, you must stop using this product, please close the account you created on this product; if you are a guardian, please help your minor child close the account he or she created on this product.
+
